OL,3,ANorthern Lights dance across UK sky on
OL,4,AHalloween night
OL,5,
OL,6,FAurora activity may continue into
OL,7,FSunday night, especially in northern
OL,8,Fskies, but the display is likely to be
OL,9,Fless intense than the one seen on
OL,10,FHalloween night.
